Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|custom.properties|default.layout.template.id=1_column|
		|testray.main.component.name|Mentions|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG
	And Page add
		|pageName|Wiki Page|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Wiki|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Wiki Page|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And User add CP
		|userEmailAddress||
		|userFirstName|userfn|
		|userLastName|userln|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And User edit Password CP
		|password|password|
		|userEmailAddress||
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And User assign Regular Role CP
		|roleTitle|Administrator|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|Server Administration|
	And ServerAdministration configure Mail Server Settings
		|userName||
		|userPassword||
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Wiki Page|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|Virtual Instances|
	And PortalInstances edit CP
		|mailDomain|gmail.com|
		|virtualHost|localhost|
	Then Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Wiki Page|

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: View Wiki Comment Mentioned User
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|test.name.skip.portal.instance|MentionsWiki#ViewWikiCommentMentionedUser|
	When Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Wiki|
	And WikiNavigator goto Node
		|wikiNodeName|Main|
	And WikiNavigator goto All Pages CP
	And Click at locator 'Button#PLUS'
	And WikiEntry add Page Title
		|wikiPageTitle|Wiki Page Title|
	And WikiEntry add Page Content
		|wikiPageContent|Wiki Page Content|
	And PortletEntry publish
	And Navigator open URL
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Wiki Page|
	And WikiNavigator goto All Pages PG
	And WikiNavigator goto Entry Via PG Table
		|wikiPageTitle|Wiki Page Title|
	And Pause at locator '30000'
	And Mentions add Mention Via Comments
		|entryComment|Comment mentioning|
		|mentionsUserFullName|userfn userln|
		|mentionsUserScreenName|usersn|
	Then Mentions view Comment Mention Tag Link
		|mentionsUserFullName|userfn userln|
		|mentionsUserScreenName|usersn|